{
  "id": "create",
  "label": "Create an appointment",
  "hint": "Draw a slot, enter a title, and save.",
  "anchor": "drag-create",
  "initial": {
    "view": "preferred",
    "theme": "light",
    "density": 6,
    "zoom": 1.3,
    "controls": []
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "find",
      "target": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "action": "draw-event",
      "reference": "[data-event-id=\"2026-10-19-event-0\"]",
      "grid": "[data-slot=\"calendar-cell\"][data-date=\"2026-10-19\"][data-calendar-id=\"person-0\"]",
      "viewport": ".quno-calendar-viewport",
      "startOffset": 0.5,
      "endOffset": 1.5
    },
    {
      "action": "type",
      "target": "[data-action=\"event-title\"]",
      "text": "Studio catch-up"
    },
    {
      "action": "click",
      "target": "[data-action=\"save\"]",
      "caption": "Click Save appointment"
    },
    {
      "action": "hover",
      "target": "[data-action=\"created-event\"]"
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    }
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    "Turn an empty part of the schedule into an appointment. Press and drag across a time slot, add a title, and save the result.",
    "The demonstration follows the whole interaction, from the held pointer and draft preview to the saved card."
  ]
}
